    bonds:["I'm trying to pay off an old debt I owe.", "My ill-gotten gains go to support my family.", "Something important was taken from me, and I aim to steal it back.", "I will become the greatest thief who ever lived.", "I'm guilty of a terrible crime, and still have nightmares.", "Someone I loved died because of a mistake I made."],
    flaws:["When I see something valuable, I can't think about anything but how to steal it.", "When faced with a choice, I take the greediest option.", "If there's a plan, I'll forget it.", "I have a weakness for attractive people.", "I turn tail and run when things look bad.", "An innocent person is in prison for a crime I committed."],
