    ideals:["Beauty: When I perform, I make the world better than it was. (Good)", "Tradition: Stories preserve the old ways and keep them alive. (Lawful)", "Creativity: The world needs new ideas and bold action. (Chaotic)", "Greed: I'm only in it for the money and fame. (Evil)", "Sincerity: No acting \u2014 I'm just being myself. (Neutral)", "People: I like seeing the smiles when I perform. (Good)"],
    bonds:["My instrument is my most treasured possession.", "Someone stole my precious instrument, and someday I'll get it back.", "I want to be famous, whatever it takes.", "I idolize a hero of the old tales.", "I will do anything to prove myself superior to a rival.", "I would do anything for a former teacher."],
    flaws:["I'll do anything to win fame and renown.", "I'm a sucker for a pretty face.", "A scandal prevents me from going home again.", "I once satirized a noble who hasn't forgotten.", "I have trouble keeping my true feelings hidden.", "Despite my best efforts, I am unreliable to my friends."],
